    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-053-zhaoming-children-rendered:p002",
      "text": "所著文集二十卷，又撰古今典誥文言為正序十卷，五言詩之善者為英華集二十卷，文選三十卷。",
      "text_sha256": "8f14b613838de849a226a0c7fefb4167171f88078dfd35bcf286253dc109346f",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "named_mentions_first_pass",
